# README table of contents

Whenever you edit `README.md`, review the top link list and update it in the same change if sections were added, removed, renamed, or reordered.

TOC links use the `https://github.com/vector-charts/vector-charts-cli#...` prefix and must match current top-level `##` section anchors.
